    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>Misplaced Soul · уровень 6</b></p><p>You gain the ability to spend Sorcery Points to have your<br>Misplaced Soul perform specific actions.<br>Metamagic: Thrash (1 Sorcery Point). You may use a<br>Bonus Action to have your Misplaced Soul use its Thrash attack. This can also be done as part of the Bonus Action you use to summon a Misplaced Soul.<br>Metamagic: Reduce Harm (2 Sorcery Points).  You may have your Misplaced Soul use its Reduce Harm as a<br>Reaction when a creature within 5 feet of it is hit by an attack.</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>Thrash бросается из карточки души. Перенос урона и остаток сверх HP — вручную.</li></ul>"
    },
